{"unit_id":"haitang1__dsh-memory#card-zh","repo":"haitang1/dsh-memory","commit":"15de1c791bbcb5be2c9b0c2096eddedcaa61cc17","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 为 DeepSeek Harness 增加跨会话的长期记忆。它将原始记忆和摘要保存在本地 Markdown 文件中，把有预算限制的摘要注入每次提示，并在 root agent 完成回合后自动整理对话，定期合并摘要。用户和 agent 可通过工具读取、添加、更新、删除、搜索、合并、导入导出及回滚记忆，也可按全局、工作区或项目划分作用域；Web 插件页提供中英文配置表单。适合希望 DSH 记住偏好、项目事实和历史决策的用户。默认不需额外密钥；可选向量检索配置 OpenAI-compatible embeddings 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:475-498","lib/index.js:1085-1150","lib/index.js:1246-1305"]}
{"unit_id":"haitang1__dsh-memory#card-en","repo":"haitang1/dsh-memory","commit":"15de1c791bbcb5be2c9b0c2096eddedcaa61cc17","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-memory adds persistent memory to DeepSeek Harness. It stores Markdown entries locally, injects a bounded summary into prompts, and distills completed turns for consolidation. Tools search and manage global, workspace, or project memories. A Web form configures the plugin.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:475-498","lib/index.js:1085-1150","lib/index.js:1246-1305"]}
