{"unit_id":"haitang1__dsh-memory#feature-1","repo":"haitang1/dsh-memory","commit":"15de1c791bbcb5be2c9b0c2096eddedcaa61cc17","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 的功能「跨会话摘要注入」：每次组装提示时读取本地记忆摘要，并按字节或估算 token 上限截断；启用作用域记忆时，还可加入当前工作区或项目摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:475-498"]}
