{"unit_id":"haitang1__dsh-memory#feature-3","repo":"haitang1/dsh-memory","commit":"15de1c791bbcb5be2c9b0c2096eddedcaa61cc17","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 的功能「记忆管理与检索」：通过 memory_* 工具添加、读取、搜索和维护条目；搜索支持标签、模糊匹配以及可选向量排序。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1085-1150","lib/index.js:1246-1305","lib/store.js:960-980"]}
{"unit_id":"haitang1__dsh-memory#caveat-1","repo":"haitang1/dsh-memory","commit":"15de1c791bbcb5be2c9b0c2096eddedcaa61cc17","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-memory 默认使用本地哈希向量；若配置 embeddingBaseURL、embeddingModel 并启用向量搜索，查询和候选记忆文本会发送至该 embeddings 服务，API key 可选配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/store.js:661-670","lib/store.js:680-700","lib/index.js:1301-1304"]}
